<body>
    <h1>Transfer To External</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The "Transfer To External" panel is a feature designed to seamlessly tra=
nsfer callers to an external number based on their selections within the IV=
R flow.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wra=
pper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-ima=
ge image-center" width=3D"376" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"fdd1ac65f91dd565e3f5=
a924e7749af666b4030e0772c460195c46b0827572f7" data-image-src=3D"https://sha=
rpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3424714774/Screenshot%202024=
-10-25%20at%201.32.55%E2%80%AFPM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D172=
9888390348&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"113" data-widt=
h=3D"538" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"42=
34018841" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"a=
ttachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-25 at 1=
.32.55=E2=80=AFPM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wik=
i" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-con=
tainer-id=3D"3424714774" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-=
media-id=3D"ca947920-fab6-45bc-8a5e-31afda40c818" data-media-type=3D"file" =
height=3D"78"></span>
<h3 id=3D"TransferToExternal-Usingthispanel">Using this panel</h3>
<p>Any customer contacts that exist outside your company can have interacti=
ons routed to them using this panel. For example, if your company has multi=
ple sites with different purposes, you may want to include this panel in yo=
ur Logic flow for scenarios where a customer needs to be redirected to the =
correct site.</p>
<h3 id=3D"TransferToExternal-Configuration">Configuration</h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Set as Flow Initiator:</strong> Selecting "Set as Flow Initiator=
" designates this panel as the starting point of the IVR flow, initiating t=
he sequence before progressing to subsequent panels within the Logic+ flow.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Name:</strong> Choose a consistent name for the panel, and=
 specify the variable to update. If the variable does not already exist, it=
 will be created.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Description:</strong> Provide a clear description detailin=
g the panel's purpose and functionality. This acts as documentation, facili=
tating better understanding and identification of the panel's intended use =
by others.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Transfer Number</strong>: The designated ten-digit number to whi=
ch a caller is directed.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exit Paths:</strong> This path is taken if there was an error.</=
p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" width=3D"238" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"a9baa7badd7be9b9fbc3a7fb5f02356=
0b574a557b9942dfb74dd8653194f8904" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atla=
ssian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3424714774/Screenshot%202024-10-28%20at=
%201.29.33%E2%80%AFPM-20241028-203041.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1730147548254&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"363" dat=
a-width=3D"198" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"4239687695" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-typ=
e=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-10-2=
8 at 1.29.33=E2=80=AFPM-20241028-203041.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharp=
encx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" da=
ta-linked-resource-container-id=3D"3424714774" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"b9013646-48d2-4df7-abd6-e2a376201a46" dat=
a-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"434"></span>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
